      "writtenOn": "2023-11-21T08:26:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "MFCs are only added in handleMulticastNocacheUpcall, and at most 1 can be added at a time. So the mMfcs.size() would first hit MFC_MAX_NUMBER_OF_ENTRIES before it becomes greater.",
